  step("Let it cure before using the tub", "<p>Silicone skins over in about 30 minutes but needs about 24 hours to cure. Keep water off it until then, or follow your product's cure time if it's longer.</p><p><strong>Done right:</strong> after 24 hours the bead is firm and doesn't dent when pressed.</p>"),
